{
  "operators": [
    {
      "name": "avgpool2d_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[N, C, H, W]",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "kernel_h",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "kernel_w",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "stride_h",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "stride_w",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "padding_h",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "padding_w",
          "kind": "int",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[N, C, floor((H + 2*padding_h - kernel_h)/stride_h + 1), floor((W + 2*padding_w - kernel_w)/stride_w + 1)]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.avg_pool(x)，其中 self.avg_pool = nn.AvgPool2d(kernel_size=(2,2), stride=(2,2), padding=0)。",
        "实际调用为 AvgPool2d 前向，输入为 CUDA 浮点张量，输出为平均池化结果。",
        "池化核在高度和宽度上均为 2，步长均为 2，无 padding，输出尺寸为输入尺寸的一半。",
        "对每个输出位置，计算窗口内所有元素的平均值，窗口不重叠，覆盖所有通道和批次。",
        "返回张量形状与参考一致，dtype 保持 float32。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "hardtanh_forward",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "same as avgpool2d_forward output",
          "layout": "contiguous",
          "nullable": false,
          "optional": false
        },
        {
          "name": "min_val",
          "kind": "float",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        },
        {
          "name": "max_val",
          "kind": "float",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "same as x"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = self.hardtanh(x)，其中 self.hardtanh = nn.Hardtanh(min_val=-1.0, max_val=1.0)。",
        "实际调用为 Hardtanh 前向，将输入张量逐元素截断到 [min_val, max_val] 区间。",
        "min_val 和 max_val 为标量浮点参数，与构造函数中保存的值一致。",
        "对输入张量的每个元素执行 clip(x, min_val, max_val)，保持形状和 dtype。",
        "返回张量与输入张量形状相同，dtype 为 float32。"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = self.avg_pool(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "AvgPool2d 前向，kernel=(2,2), stride=(2,2), padding=0，输出 [16,3,1024,1024]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = self.hardtanh(x)",
      "semantics": [
        "Hardtanh 前向，min_val=-1.0, max_val=1.0，逐元素 clip，输出 [16,3,1024,1024]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_003",
      "source": "return x",
      "semantics": [
        "返回最终结果 [16,3,1024,1024]"
      ]
